# Applied to docker/Dockerfile.base only (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to
# the Dockerfile before the context root's .dockerignore). The context is the repo root.
#
# .git is deliberately NOT ignored: hatch-vcs derives the version from the git tag in
# the build stage, and the multi-stage build keeps it out of the runtime image.
#
# Only ignore paths git ignores too (see .gitignore). Leaving out a tracked path makes the
# build stage's checkout look modified, and hatch-vcs then stamps the version with a
# date: a v0.1.0 build comes out as 0.1.0.post1.dev0+d20261001.
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
build
dist
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
.coverage
htmlcov
**/*.ckpt
**/*.safetensors
**/*.zarr
**/*.nc
scratch
data
**/.DS_Store
